WEBVTT

00:08:26.669 --> 00:08:31.590
but actually to take on the characters
of the five brightest stars in the galaxy.

00:08:31.632 --> 00:08:36.845
And that’s Canopus, Rigel,
Arcturus, Vega and Sirius.

00:08:37.221 --> 00:08:39.265
And also, when we hand them
the board game,

00:08:39.306 --> 00:08:41.308
we remind them that they are already stars

00:08:41.308 --> 00:08:43.060
who are interacting with one another

00:08:43.102 --> 00:08:45.729
to help each other
just shine a little bit brighter.

00:08:46.063 --> 00:08:49.817
And perhaps our biggest impact
was realized in 2020 and 2021.

00:08:50.359 --> 00:08:51.860
Like most of you remember,

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:55.197
these are the two years when COVID-19
pandemic decided to visit us.

00:08:55.739 --> 00:08:59.535
And during this time,
classes in the refugee camp closed,

00:08:59.577 --> 00:09:03.289
and children were sent home with no way
of accessing learning resources.